{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"12627","tmdb_id":"movie/12627","media_type":"movie","title":"不羁的美女","original_title":"La Belle Noiseuse","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xI9c3u1XuNt5ACk41Vc2Ybfyi3v.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFXrPXV6GjWK5mQZYMncve0bisi.jpg","overview":"弗兰霍夫（米歇尔·皮寇利 Michel Piccoli 饰）是一个功成名就的画家，妻子利兹（简·伯金 Jane Birkin 饰）一直都是他创作的源泉和模特，这也是利兹感到自豪的所在。但是这些年来，弗兰霍夫的创作灵感渐渐枯竭，当他面对着妻子的肖像画时，甚至感到无从下笔。当玛利亚娜（艾曼纽·贝阿 Emmanuelle Béart 饰）经朋友介绍出现在他眼前时，他已经有将近十年没有拿起过画笔了。性感奔放的玛利亚娜的出现重新点燃了画家的激情，他们两人在封闭的画室里整日疯狂的作画。利兹努力的克制自己的嫉妒心，但当弗兰霍夫将妻子的肖像画用玛利亚娜的人体覆盖的时候，利兹无法忍耐了，她和画家之间发生了争吵。画作完成了，但弗兰霍夫却做出了一个惊人的举动，他将完美的画作永远的砌进了石墙里，从此，这副杰作将永远的隐藏于黑暗之中。","release_date":"1991-09-04","first_air_date":"","year":"1991","runtime":"236","episode_run_time":"","number_of_episodes":0,"number_of_seasons":0,"genres":["剧情"],"languages":["English","Français"],"countries":["France","Switzerland"],"tmdb_rating":"7.3 / 10 from 307 users","tmdb_rating_average":7.28,"tmdb_votes":307,"imdb_id":"tt0101428","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0101428/","imdb_rating":"7.5 / 10 from 10814 users","imdb_rating_average":"7.5","imdb_votes":"10814","directors":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":73153,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"雅克·里维特","original_name":"Jacques Rivette","popularity":0.6648,"profile_path":"/rJVyIQcU8CcCkWOuThhY1g5SrSh.jpg","credit_id":"52fe450b9251416c75049bfd","department":"Directing","job":"Director"}],"producers":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":41021,"known_for_department":"Production","name":"Martine Marignac","original_name":"Martine Marignac","popularity":0.0915,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"52fe450b9251416c75049beb","department":"Production","job":"Producer"}],"writers":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":64750,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"帕斯卡尔·博尼策","original_name":"Pascal Bonitzer","popularity":0.5281,"profile_path":"/eVtjnCqgBi8bYowmmxQLLq4Sw4y.jpg","credit_id":"52fe450a9251416c75049bc7","department":"Writing","job":"Screenplay"},{"adult